# Keep text files LF in the working tree: the Skill entry tests reject CR, and
# Actions checks out with core.autocrlf=true by default on Windows.
* text=auto eol=lf

# PowerShell 5.1 is happiest with CRLF and a BOM; leave those to the files.
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 61/62 用原始字节 SHA256 校验已安装的语义辅助脚本（不忽略行尾）。套件侧与本案
# 的同一文件均为索引 LF、检出 CRLF（i/lf w/crlf），两仓交叉验收同一安装根时只
# 比较工作区字节，因此单独把这一份固定为 CRLF；其余 .py 不参与字节校验，保持 LF，
# 避免将来 renormalize 产生整文件 diff。
assets/scripts/recall_embedding.py text eol=crlf
